### ✅ Secured
```javascript
// Email masking function
const maskEmail = (email) => {
  if (!email) return '';
  const [local, domain] = email.split('@');
  if (!local || !domain) return email;
  return `${local.substring(0, 2)}***@${domain}`;
};

// Data sanitization based on permissions
const sanitizeUserData = (user, hasFullAccess = false) => {
  return {
    id: user.id,
    name: user.name,
    email: hasFullAccess ? user.email : maskEmail(user.email)
  };
};

app.get('/users', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  const users = [...];

  // Only admins see full emails
  const hasFullAccess = req.user && req.user.role === 'admin';

  const sanitizedUsers = users.map(user => 
    sanitizeUserData(user, hasFullAccess)
  );

  res.json(sanitizedUsers);
});
```

**Security Benefit**: 
- PII protection
- Role-based data access
- GDPR compliance
- Data minimization

