## 🚨 Common Vulnerabilities to Avoid

| Vulnerability | Example | Fix |
|---------------|---------|-----|
| SQL Injection | `"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = " + id` | Use parameterized queries |
| XSS | `res.send("<div>" + userInput + "</div>")` | Sanitize with `validator.escape()` |
| Broken Auth | No token validation | Use JWT middleware |
| Sensitive Data | `console.log(user.password)` | Never log secrets |
| No Rate Limit | Unlimited requests | Use express-rate-limit |
| Missing Headers | No security headers | Use Helmet |
| Weak Passwords | `password: "123456"` | Enforce strong passwords |
| No HTTPS | HTTP only | Enforce HTTPS redirect |

