   - Automate rotation where possible
   - Have rollback procedures
   - Test rotation regularly

6. Audit all secret access
   - Log who accessed what and when
   - Send logs to SIEM
   - Alert on suspicious access patterns

7. Development vs Production
   - Different secrets for each environment
   - Mock/stub external services in dev
   - Never use production secrets in dev

8. Emergency procedures
   - Have secret revocation process
   - Maintain break-glass access
   - Document incident response
