## 🚫 Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### DON'T:
```javascript
// ❌ Hardcoded secrets
const JWT_SECRET = 'my-secret-key';

// ❌ Logged secrets
console.log('JWT Secret:', process.env.JWT_SECRET);

// ❌ Exposed in error messages
